---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/HeroSection.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Foundation Repair in Flint & Gresham, TX | Tyler Foundation Pros"
  description="Foundation problems in Flint or Gresham, TX? Tyler Foundation Pros connects unincorporated Smith County homeowners with licensed contractors. Free inspections. Call (903) 582-7837."
>
  <HeroSection
    h1="Foundation Repair in Flint & Gresham, TX"
    subheading="We connect Flint and Gresham homeowners with licensed local foundation repair contractors — same service, same free inspection as Tyler proper."
    buttonText="Call (903) 582-7837 — Free Flint/Gresham Inspection"
  />

  <section class="py-14 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg mb-4">
        The unincorporated communities of Flint and Gresham, south of Tyler, represent some of the densest residential areas in Smith County that often get overlooked by larger foundation companies focused on Tyler proper.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg">
        Tyler Foundation Pros connects Flint and Gresham homeowners with licensed local foundation repair contractors. We make sure you get the same quality response and expert assessment as any Tyler homeowner — without having to track down contractors yourself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-14 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Foundation Issues in Flint and Gresham</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The Flint and Gresham area has a mix of housing stock — from homes built in the 1970s and 80s to newer infill construction. Older homes in this area are frequently on pier-and-beam foundations that have gone decades without inspection, while newer construction sits on slabs that are beginning to show their first signs of settlement.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700">
        The soil throughout this corridor is consistent with the rest of East Texas: heavy clay that shrinks and swells with the seasons and creates predictable foundation stress over time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-14 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Don't Get Overlooked — We Serve Flint and Gresham</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700">
        Many national foundation companies prioritize Tyler zip codes and deprioritize unincorporated areas. If you're in the 75762 zip code area, call us — we'll connect you with a licensed local contractor who covers your area. Same free inspection, same quality service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    heading="Schedule Your Free Flint / Gresham Inspection"
    subtext="Licensed local contractors who actually show up. Free inspection, written estimate — no pressure."
    buttonText="Call (903) 582-7837 — Free Flint/Gresham Inspection"
  />
</Layout>
